{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_logging_file_sink_filesink", "label": "FileSink", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/logging/file-sink.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Schreibt Records in Dateien, benannt nach dem Moment, in dem sie geoeffnet wurden."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_logging_file_sink_filesinkoptions", "label": "FileSinkOptions", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/logging/file-sink.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "directory, prefix, extension, format, maxFileBytes, rotateInterval, maxFiles, maxAgeMs, compressRotated plus der gemeinsame delivery-Block."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_logging_file_sink_rollover_triggers", "label": "Rollover-Ausloeser", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/logging/file-sink.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Groesse und Uhrzeit greifen zusammen. rotateInterval meint die Uhrzeitgrenze, nicht 24 Stunden nach dem Start: ein um 09:41 gestarteter Prozess rollt zur naechsten Mitternacht."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_logging_file_sink_no_rename_on_rollover", "label": "Beim Rollover wird nie umbenannt", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/logging/file-sink.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Windows verweigert das Umbenennen einer geoeffneten Datei, ein Rename-Schema scheitert dort also oder muss erst schliessen und mit allem konkurrieren, was noch schreibt. Die naechste gestempelte Datei zu oeffnen hat keins von beiden Problemen \u2014 pino-roll und winston-daily-rotate-file sind bei derselben Antwort gelandet."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_logging_file_sink_record_never_split", "label": "Kein Record wird auf zwei Dateien aufgeteilt", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/logging/file-sink.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Die Rollover-Pruefung laeuft vor jeder Zeile, nicht pro Batch: ein Batch ueber der Groessengrenze beendet die aktuelle Zeile, rollt und schreibt in der neuen Datei weiter."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_logging_file_sink_retention_policy", "label": "Retention", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/logging/file-sink.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "maxFiles und maxAgeMs gelten beide, 0 schaltet die jeweilige ab. Geloescht werden ausschliesslich die eigenen Dateien dieses Sinks \u2014 Praefix, Extension und exakte Zeitstempelform muessen passen, die aktive Datei nie \u2014, damit ein geteiltes Log-Verzeichnis unversehrt bleibt. Kompression laeuft, nachdem die neue Datei offen ist."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_logging_file_sink_file_naming", "label": "Benennung", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/logging/file-sink.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Default log-<yyyy-MM-dd>-<HH-mm-ss>.txt in lokaler Zeit \u2014 die Uhr, die jemand im Kopf hat, der wissen will, was gegen drei passiert ist. prefix und extension duerfen weder Punkt noch Pfadtrenner enthalten, weil sie auch in das Retention-Muster eingehen und ein verirrtes ../ Loeschungen fehlleiten wuerde. Ein schon existierender Name bekommt -2, -3 statt anzuhaengen."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_logging_file_sink_durability_window", "label": "Dauerhaftigkeit", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/logging/file-sink.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Bis zu flush-interval kann ein Record geloggt, aber noch nicht geschrieben sein; die Alternative waere ein Syscall pro Record. Die Datei selbst steht nicht auf dem Spiel: Schreibvorgaenge laufen in einer Schleife, das Rollover benennt nie um, und terminate() leert die Queue \u2014 ein abgestuerzter Prozess hinterlaesst eine bis zur Record-Grenze vollstaendige Datei."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_logging_file_sink_cross_runtime_single_implementation", "label": "Eine Implementierung fuer Bun, Node und Deno", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/logging/file-sink.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Append-Handle, readdir und unlink kommen alle aus node:fs/promises, das die Kompatibilitaetsschichten von Bun und Deno abdecken; ein Smoke-Case faehrt den Sink auf allen dreien, damit die Behauptung ehrlich bleibt."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_logging_file_sink_sink_disabled_on_directory_failure", "label": "Sink deaktiviert sich bei Verzeichnisfehlern", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/logging/file-sink.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ein read-only gemountetes Dateisystem oder ein falscher Pfad ist seiner Natur nach dauerhaft \u2014 der Sink meldet einmal und schaltet sich ab, statt eine Meldung alle zwei Sekunden ueber die gesamte Prozesslaufzeit zu schreiben. Alles andere laeuft ueber den normalen Retry-Pfad."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_logging_file_sink_filesink", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_logging_file_sink_filesinkoptions", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/logging/file-sink.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_logging_file_sink_filesink", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_logging_file_sink_rollover_triggers", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/logging/file-sink.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_logging_file_sink_filesink", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_logging_file_sink_retention_policy", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/logging/file-sink.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_logging_file_sink_filesink", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_logging_file_sink_file_naming", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/logging/file-sink.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_logging_file_sink_no_rename_on_rollover", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_logging_file_sink_rollover_triggers", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/logging/file-sink.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_logging_file_sink_record_never_split", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_logging_file_sink_rollover_triggers", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/logging/file-sink.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_logging_file_sink_file_naming", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_logging_file_sink_retention_policy", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/logging/file-sink.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_logging_file_sink_durability_window", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_logging_file_sink_filesink", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/logging/file-sink.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_logging_file_sink_cross_runtime_single_implementation", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_logging_file_sink_filesink", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/logging/file-sink.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_logging_file_sink_sink_disabled_on_directory_failure", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_logging_file_sink_filesink", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/logging/file-sink.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_logging_file_sink_no_rename_on_rollover", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_logging_file_sink_durability_window", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/co